        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "In addition, we previously co-developed seltorexant with Janssen Pharmaceutica NV (“Janssen”), a subsidiary of Johnson & Johnson, for the treatment of insomnia disorder and adjunctive treatment of Major Depressive Disorder (“MDD”).",
